OL,3,AProsecutors plan to retry Lindsay
OL,4,AClancy for deaths of her three children
OL,5,
OL,6,FLindsay Clancy is back in court for a
OL,7,Fhearing that could decide whether she
OL,8,Fwill be retried for killing her three
OL,9,Fyoung children in 2023
OL,11,FThe Massachusetts woman's murder trial
OL,12,Ffell apart in September when a jury
OL,13,Fcould not unanimously decide on a
OL,14,Fverdict
OL,16,FProsecutors have said at the hearing
OL,17,Fthat they plan to retry the case, but
OL,18,Fdon't know "what that looks like"
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
