OL,3,AProsecutors plan to retry Lindsay
OL,4,AClancy for deaths of her three children
OL,5,
OL,6,FLawyers on both sides are arguing about
OL,7,Fnext steps following the mistrial as
OL,8,Fthe defence argues the case should be
OL,9,Fdismissed entirely
OL,11,FProsecutors are considering whether to
OL,12,Fseek a new trial - and they could put
OL,13,Fforward a date for that on Monday
OL,15,FThere have been tense moments as the
OL,16,Fdefence team questions how the judge
OL,17,Fhandled the single holdout juror and
OL,18,Fthe judge has threatened to stop the
OL,19,Fhearing
